OL,3,GNEWSASeal pups spotted at nature
OL,4,Areserve for 12th year
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeal pups have been recorded at a
OL,7,Fnature reserve for the 12th year
OL,8,Frunning.
OL,10,FCumbria Wildlife Trust confirmed two
OL,11,Fpups had been spotted at South Walney
OL,12,FNature Reserve near Barrow, Cumbria.
OL,14,FThe reserve is home to the county's
OL,15,Fonly breeding grey seal colony and
OL,16,Fmajor haul-out site, a spot where seals
OL,17,Fcome to shore for rest.
OL,19,FA record number of 14 seal pups were
OL,20,Fcounted at the nature reserve last
OL,21,Fyear, with the trust saying it hoped
OL,22,Fthere would be "many more to come".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
